---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Docs — Fornax">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>Docs</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Public documentation — no login required. This is a Phase 1 draft; content will expand as features ship.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="docs-body">
    <nav class="docs-nav">
      <a href="#getting-started">Getting Started</a>
      <a href="#integrations">Integrations</a>
      <a href="#troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</a>
      <a href="#best-practices">Best Practices</a>
    </nav>

    <article id="getting-started" class="docs-section">
      <h2>Getting Started</h2>
      <p>After you request a demo, here's what happens:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>We build your site from your business name, trade, service area and logo (if you have one).</li>
        <li>You get a demo link showing your actual site and a preview of your dashboard.</li>
        <li>If you say yes, you choose Managed (we host it) or Offboard (you take it), pay, and your site is live in about a minute.</li>
        <li>Your dashboard login arrives by email. From there you can edit text, contact info and images (Micro), or colors, fonts and gallery content (SMB).</li>
      </ol>
      <p>There's no website editor to learn and no separate hosting account to set up on Managed plans.</p>
    </article>

    <article id="integrations" class="docs-section">
      <h2>Integrations</h2>
      <p>CRM sync is available on the SMB tier and above. At launch:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>HubSpot</strong> — first CRM integration, one-way sync (new leads push into HubSpot automatically).</li>
        <li><strong>Jobber, ServiceTitan, Housecall Pro, Successware</strong> — planned next, not yet available.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Per-CRM setup guides will be published here as each integration ships. None are published yet beyond this overview.</p>
    </article>

    <article id="troubleshooting" class="docs-section">
      <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>
      <p>Common questions while this product is early:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>My leads aren't showing up in my CRM.</strong> Confirm CRM sync is enabled for your tier (SMB and above) and that your CRM connection shows "Connected" in your dashboard.</li>
        <li><strong>I need to update my site's contact info or hours.</strong> Use your dashboard's edit screen — changes apply within your plan's editing scope.</li>
        <li><strong>Something looks broken on my site.</strong> Email support with a screenshot and the page URL; published response time is 24-48 hours.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This section will grow as real support tickets surface real issues — it's not exhaustive yet.</p>
    </article>

    <article id="best-practices" class="docs-section">
      <h2>Best Practices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep your Google Business Profile reviews current — they pull directly onto your site.</li>
        <li>Respond to leads quickly; response speed matters more to conversion than site polish.</li>
        <li>Use your service area setting accurately — it affects which searches your site is relevant for.</li>
        <li>On SMB, review your CRM sync weekly until you're confident leads are landing correctly.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-footer">
    <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
    <p>See <a href="/features">Features</a> and <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>, or request a <a href="/demo">demo</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 60px 20px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .tagline {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .docs-body {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 20px 60px;
  }

  .docs-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .docs-nav a {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .docs-section {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .docs-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .docs-section h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .docs-section p {
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .docs-section ul, .docs-section ol {
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.8;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .cta-footer {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 48px 20px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
  }

  .cta-footer h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .cta-footer p {
    color: #666;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
